1. import
2. In rebuildPlayerCar, create telemetry/mirror and assign materials.
3. Update loop: call updateLiveScreens after render.
4. Method updateLiveScreens.

Note: In rebuildPlayerCar, the old model removed; old screen materials reference textures reused (telemetry material persists) — assigning the same material to new meshes is fine. Old geometry disposed. Don't dispose the live textures.

Also if `playerModel` is rebuilt, the mirror material persists.

Move material creation: `if (!this.telemetry) ...` in rebuild. But `this.renderer`/`this.scene` exist by then (initGraphics before initCars). Yes.

Throttling fields init in constructor: this.screenClock = 0; this.mirrorClock = 0.

The update method must compute phase similar to HUD but simpler:
- mode race: phase = finished ? "FIM" : !greenReached ? "PREPARE" : "CORRIDA"
- finished ET.

Also gap sign: rivalDistance - playerDistance → positive means player ahead. In draw, gap>=0 shown green "+". OK.

Use `this.playerET` for finished time.

Implementation of updateLiveScreens(rdt):

```js
updateLiveScreens(rdt) {
  const sim = this.playerSim;
  if (!sim || !this.telemetry) return;
  const interval = this.mode === "race" ? 1 / 12 : 1 / 6;
  if (this.time - this.screenClock >= interval) {
    this.screenClock = this.time;
    const rsim = this.rivalSim;
    this.telemetry.draw({
      mode: this.mode,
      time: this.time,
      speed: sim.speedKmh,
      rpm: sim.rpmNorm,
      gear: sim.gear,
      distance: sim.distance,
      finish: FINISH,
      gap: rsim ? rsim.distance - sim.distance : null,
      et: this.mode === "race" && this.playerFinished ? this.playerET : null,
      phase: this.mode === "race" ? (this.playerFinished ? "FIM" : this.greenReached ? "CORRIDA" : "PREPARE") : undefined,
    });
  }

  if (this.mirrorFeed) {
    const cockpit = this.mode === "race" && this.cameraMode === "cockpit";
    const interval2 = cockpit ? 1 / 24 : 1 / 6;
    this.mirrorAcc = (this.mirrorAcc || 0) + rdt;
    if (this.mirrorAcc >= interval2) {
      this.mirrorAcc = 0;
      this.mirrorFeed.update(this.playerGroup);
    }
  }
}
```

