Where to call: after `renderer.render(...)` in frame.

Also: mirror visible in exterior views: chase view shows the mirror glass with the feed. Fine.

Concern: mirror feed shows things behind, but in the menu the car is shown from a rotating camera; the mirror will correctly show the rear road. Nice.

One more: `this.playerFinished` — verify field names exist. grep showed this.playerFinished used in updateHud; playerET too. greenReached too. Good.

